  "limitations": [
    "Owned-process DRM accounting only, not total device utilization or host process RSS. Other clients and unreported driver allocations are excluded.",
    "The roughly half-second sampler can miss transient peaks; recorded maxima are observed values, not a guaranteed upper bound.",
    "Distinct clients are deduplicated within each sample. drm-shared-vram0 was zero throughout; summing client totals does not establish total physical-device usage.",
    "drm-total-vram0 and drm-resident-vram0 are separate counters even where values agree; system/GTT counters can describe distinct or related mappings and are not combined.",
    "Pool allocation bytes are startup allocations from the server log. Attention usage is a separate page-occupancy gauge, not a measurement of physical VRAM resident bytes.",
    "This is one successful foreground run with correctness work plus benchmark A; no memory improvement versus the previous release is claimed."
